/-! ## 5. The T2 terminal

`V` and `G` are the **literal** brackets of `Pt.JTop.value` / `Box.JTop.part i`
(proved equal to the tree slots in `V_mem`/`G_mem`), so the slack below is one
pure-integer kernel computation: `Nat.sqrt` inside the tree never reaches it. -/

def V : DC := ⟨(208 : ℤ), (922361363505851178515977792457376392820949095075168230835150 : ℤ), (922505494023156412314627769521228065263040707076070996675019 : ℤ)⟩

def G : Fin 3 → DC
  | 0 => ⟨(205 : ℤ), (-391806843745531953582612389642651199745014558299201401069108 : ℤ), (1592172967320027326030476301662737522957260432147895526126715 : ℤ)⟩
