  | 2 => ⟨(204 : ℤ), (140073733717592389068060918087033614496419385979029469876670 : ℤ), (1096872102402154849217600333702933662955848221094138946280050 : ℤ)⟩

theorem V_mem : V.mem (fTop c) := by
